  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.44: math and diagrams in every output. IStemRenderer (RenderOptions.StemRenderer, AvaloniaRenderer.StemRenderer) draws STEM as SVG in HTML and EPUB (no MathJax), vector paths in PDF and on the Avalonia page; the new AdocNet.Stem package typesets LaTeX and AsciiMath offline (CSharpMath). DocBook writes equations; Markdown reads $...$ math. DiagramPass turns diagram blocks into images for direct parser users, with opt-in Kroki or local runners. Attribute lines with any style ([mermaid], [loweralpha]) no longer show as text. See CHANGELOG.md.",
